{"v3_21a0241ff879331075cc3d78":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんにちは(´˘`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46 5期生冨里奈央（とみさとなお）です\n今日9月18日で20歳になりました〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mob4ASchQ.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーーーい！！✨️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://www.instagram.com/nao.tomisato_official/インスタグラムも開設したよ🧸ずっとやりたかったから嬉しい！ぜひフォローしてね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が20歳になるなんて、なんだかまだ不思議な感じ小さい頃に想像してた20歳は、もっと大人でしっかりしてて、なんでもできる人だった気がするけど、実際の私はそんなに変わってないかも笑いまだに中学生の頃の夢ばっかりみるもん笑学生で止まりすぎている、、10代が終わっちゃったのはちょっと寂しいな〜ずっと子供でいたいって思ってた！！（甘ったれでごめんなさい🥺）大人になればなるほど、人に頼ったり相談したり甘えたりすることって少しずつ難しくなるのかな〜って思うけど、きっとこれからも心強いお姉ちゃんたちが助けてくれるよねっ私も少しずつ大人になりながら、これからも自分らしくいられたらいいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19歳のなお！⬇️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobQmq2nn.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の全国ツアー2026\n大阪タコ🐙なお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobpgcffX.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「最後に階段を駆け上がったのはいつだ？」MV撮影"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobfFgmNN.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドラマ「コントラスト」\n瑞希ちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobQe6QLI.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19歳楽しかったー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳はどんな歳になるのかな〜\nたくさん笑って、たくさん思い出を作っていきたいです☺️\n20歳の私も、皆さんと一緒に素敵な1年にしたいないつも応援してくれてありがとう!!これからもよろしくね🫶🏻20歳の冨里奈央も、いっぱい愛してください〜！"}],"source":"official"},"sba-sakura-49091":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは❄️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この後15時より、\n『武元唯衣の感じてシガリズム』放送です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月も毎週放送となります〜☺️✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週は冬にぴったりのシガリズム体験を３つもご紹介させていただくという、スペシャルな回でしたね☃️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も、一体私がどんなシガリズム体験を紹介するのか、楽しみにしていて下さい☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ11ZPRXP25JTNXPZKATC972","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんが送って下さるお便りがいつもとっても嬉しいです☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"櫻坂46や私自身の情報なども、ファンの皆様が伝えて下さったり、たくさんキッコさんがお話して下さったり、毎回櫻坂46の曲も流して下さったり、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛がいっぱいの時間です🌸"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年こそスタジオにお邪魔することが出来ますように😌✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非2月も一緒に、シガリズム感じていきましょ〜♩\nよろしくお願いします！☺️"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-9752":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は生駒ちゃんトマトちゃん(大和ちゃん)、まあやの三人でロケをしたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またその話は内容解禁されたら話すね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰りの車の中では\nめっちゃ語り合いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"語りまくりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々話した結果"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『自分をしっかりもつこと』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと運転手さんにはうるさいと思われただろうなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三人はどことなく雰囲気が似てるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんわかしてる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう話をしたり乃木坂について語りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、前回沢山のコメントありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一つ一つのコメントを心に刻みながら読ませていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分では気が付かない事に気づかせてもらえたり、温かい言葉に嬉しくて読んでて文字が見えなくなりました..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは気が付かない事も沢山あるし、\nまだまだどうやっていったらいいか迷う事も沢山あるし、\n一歩一歩新しい道を歩いてる感じです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真っ直ぐ前だけ見て進める勇気をくれて大切な時間をまあやといてくれて\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１人１人が大切な人です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いてくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな真剣に思ってくださっていて本当に嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に歩いて行ってもらえるように\n頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、この前AKB48さんのライブDVD を"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後ひなちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"橋本ななみちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒りなちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大和りなちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村さゆりちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と見ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり凄く可愛くて勉強になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで沸いてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんは\n【チームB 推し】\nの曲で史上最強に沸いてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（以前コメントで、皆の名前を入れて歌詞を替えて歌を作ってくれた方がいて嬉しかったです♪）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで『かわいー』\nを連発して\nみんなで沸いてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんな凄いグループになれたらいいなっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルっぽいかなりんと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のホクロは分かりにくかったですよね...でも中にはなぁちゃんのブログでわかった方も居ましたね...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度はどんな事をしようかな〜笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから受験生の皆さん頑張って下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合格するように祈ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんが最近頑張っていることは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0014.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-24505":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n \n 2月3日に\n 幕張メッセで行われた個別握手会\n 当日欠席してしまいすみませんでした。\n \n \n \n 私のために\n わざわざ握手券を買っていただいて\n 会場まで来てもらったのに\n 当日に欠席してしまって\n 本当に心苦しかったです。\n \n \n 私がいっぱいお願いして\n みんなが協力してくれて\n やっとの思いで\n 完売させてくれた枠だったので\n とても楽しみにしていたし\n 絶対参加したかったです。\n \n それなのに\n 欠席というかたちで\n みなさんをがっかりさせてしまって\n 本当にごめんなさい。\n \n \n 今後はこんなことがないように\n 体調管理をしっかりして\n みなさんに恩返しができるように\n 活動していきたいです。\n \n \n こんな私ですが\n これからも見捨てず\n 少しだけでも\n 応援してくれたら嬉しいです。\n \n \n 2月11日の握手会は\n こないだ出れなかった分まで\n いつも以上に楽しみにしています😊\n \n \n \n よろしくお願いします🤲\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHB72D6C9W3K0W7KRMRCVT1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-20062":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばんは꒰⑅ᵕ༚ᵕ꒱˖♡\n \n 佐々木美玲です！！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYTFJ9BPH6WVGC8QRDQRY9T","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 最近、すごい暑いから毎日ポニーテールしてる気がするʕ•ᴥ•ʔ\n \n \n \n \n 今日はレッスンがなかったから家でダンスと歌の練習したり、ギターの練習したりしてました!!\n \n \n \n \n \n もっともっと練習して、欅坂46さんみたいにかっこい！すごい！って思われるパフォーマンスができるようになりたいなଘ(੭ˊ꒳​ˋ)੭✧\n \n \n \n \n 頑張らなくちゃっっ(>人<;)\n \n \n \n \n \n 話変わりますが、最近ミニトマトが食べれるようになりました( ･ㅂ･)و ̑̑\n \n \n \n \n \n \n ﾔｯﾀ───ヽ(〃∀〃)ﾉ───♪\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 小さい頃から野菜が嫌いで全然食べられなかったんだけど大人になるにつれて徐々に色んなものが食べれるようになりました(^-^)\n \n \n \n \n \n 今日もミニトマト10個くらい食べた!\n \n \n \n \n \n めみたんが言ってたんやけど、ミニトマトは美白効果もあるらしいです♡\n \n \n \n いっぱい食べなくちゃ♡(*´∀｀*)\n \n \n \n \n 長くなっちゃっけど最後まで読んでくれてありがとうございますっ(｡･ω･｡)\n \n \n \n \n また明日更新するので見て下さいね〜\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYTFKAFDPBBVZJWCJCCVWX4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n ＊佐々木美玲＊"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-37235":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは、渡辺です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/03/07/8960080/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、幕張メッセにて握手会が\nありました。\n来て下さった皆様、ありがとうございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/03/07/8960080/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.3部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/03/07/8960080/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらも好評で嬉しかったな〜\n2部終わりには絢音の生誕祭にて\nお手紙を読ませてもらいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お手紙書くことは前日に分かっていたのに\nそのままぴーすかぱーすか寝てしまいまして\n朝起きた時、『あ、やってもうた』と\n思いましたね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急いで車の中で携帯のメモ書きにメモして\n携帯を読みながら挑みました\nグダグダになってしまい、ごめんなさい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/03/07/8960080/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに楽屋もお隣さん、\n気付けば自然と隣にいます\nいつもありがとう、そしておめでとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また今週にも握手会あるなんて\nテンションフィーバーって感じですね\n( いやどんな感じだよ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウェルカムホームな感じで\nお待ちしています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"定期的に整体に行っているのですが\n混んでて予約のとれないところ\nに行きたくて、やっと取れたんですよ\nなので行ってみたところ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「背中触らせていただいたんですけど触った感じ心臓の後ろらへんのここの筋肉がかったいですねー。心臓の後ろなのでかなり大事ですが、固いのでストレスを感じていて疲れてるんじゃないかなと思います」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまではいいんですよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ズズズーと下に行くとここの筋肉も固いですね、ここは肝臓の後ろなのでここが固いのは、人の目を気にし過ぎていたり周りのことに気を配り過ぎているんじゃないかなあ？それの神経の疲れというか、ストレスがここにくるのね。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"占い師かよ、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思った1日でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2017/03/07/8960080/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで問題です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のポーズを相談したこの方は誰でしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( 難しすぎるとか言わないでね )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LOVEberry 発売中です。\n飛鳥さん、絢音、蓮加ちゃん、みり愛で\n出ています。ぜひ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-15801":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださって\nありがとうございました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はポートメッセなごやで\n全握でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブのセトリは\n横浜全握と一緒で\n7th収録曲フルでやったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手は\nゆったんまあや中田の14レーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16時